WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.701 --> 00:00:05.982
Castvoo pays you for sharing it.

2
00:00:06.112 --> 00:00:09.199
Open Earn to find your own referral link.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.075
Copy it, or share it straight to Telegram, WhatsApp, X or email.

4
00:00:14.374 --> 00:00:21.791
When people sign up through your link and pay for a plan, you earn a share of every payment, every month, for as long as they pay.

5
00:00:22.092 --> 00:00:29.120
You get five percent with one to four paying referrals, ten percent from five, and fifteen percent from twenty.

6
00:00:29.422 --> 00:00:31.879
Earnings settle after 30 days.

7
00:00:32.009 --> 00:00:38.275
Use them on your own plan any time, or withdraw from 300 dollars, in USDT or Bitcoin.

8
00:00:38.575 --> 00:00:39.950
Need help?

9
00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:41.540
Open Help.

10
00:00:41.670 --> 00:00:44.783
You can chat with our support team, day and night.

11
00:00:45.082 --> 00:00:48.121
The first answers come from AI assistants.

12
00:00:48.251 --> 00:00:53.401
They can check your own account, like your bot or a payment, and reply in seconds.

13
00:00:53.701 --> 00:00:56.313
Here's the answer, right in the chat.

14
00:00:57.554 --> 00:01:00.470
Some things need a person, like refunds.

15
00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:03.889
Then the AI hands you over to our human team.

16
00:01:04.019 --> 00:01:06.487
You can also just ask for a person.

17
00:01:06.787 --> 00:01:11.991
A team member joins the same chat, and picks up right where the assistant left off.

18
00:01:12.555 --> 00:01:16.042
You can also email support@castvoo.com.

19
00:01:16.172 --> 00:01:17.712
Happy sending!
